---
// src/components/FirmIntro.astro
---

<section id="about" class="bg-[#f7f6f3] py-28 sm:py-36 text-[#111111]">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-14">
    <!-- Editorial Headline Statement -->
    <div class="max-w-[1200px]">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] font-normal leading-[1.25] tracking-tight text-[#111111]">
        hill is a pre-eminent law firm serving a global client base in Capital, Private Wealth, M&A and Disputes. We advise them on their most significant transactions, their most sensitive disputes, and the long-term structuring of their affairs.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Sub-row: 2 Column Layout with ample top space -->
    <div class="mt-24 sm:mt-32 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-10">
      <!-- Left Column: Details + Button -->
      <div class="max-w-md space-y-7">
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-[13.5px] text-[#555555] font-light leading-relaxed">
          We do not organise strictly along departmental lines. Instead, we draw lawyers from across the firm to form a team suited to the specific needs of each client and matter, so clients get direct access to the right people rather than being passed between disconnected specialists.
        </p>

        <div>
          <a
            href="#practices"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-black text-white text-xs font-normal px-5 py-3 rounded-none hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Discover our firm</span>
            <span class="text-sm">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Subtle Badge Label -->
      <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#777777] font-medium self-end pb-1">
        INDEPENDENT THINKING · INTERNATIONAL REACH
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>